cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use or write about a result in this repository, please link to that
  result's page and cite the original source of the conjecture as well.
type: software
title: "Conjecture proofs: machine-checked proofs and disproofs of conjectures from recent papers"
authors:
  # TODO before publication: the author's name, spelled as he wants it shown.
  - family-names: "TODO"
    given-names: "TODO"
repository-code: "https://github.com/marcosmartinsalvador/conjecture-proofs"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - mathematical conjectures
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formal verification
  - counterexamples
abstract: >-
  Unrefereed proofs, disproofs and partial results on conjectures from recent
  mathematics papers and problem lists, found with AI agents and checked in
  Lean 4 against Mathlib. Each result states its source, what exactly is
  proved, how it was checked, and how sure it is to be new.
